==Battleground==
*10 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 5~15 seconds<sup>150f~450f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win. [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Jurassic Cat]] can make quick work of the [[Metal Hippoe]].

